cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this work informs yours, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Logic Layer: a command-line logic engine for coding agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Sitka
    given-names: Emanuel
repository-code: "https://github.com/Emanuel-Sitka/logiclayer"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A command-line logic engine for coding agents. The agent writes facts and
  rules into SWI-Prolog and gets answers with a proof and the assumptions they
  rest on. Includes a benchmark comparing an agent with and without the tool,
  in which both scored 20 out of 20.
keywords:
  - prolog
  - logic
  - agents
  - reasoning
  - explainability
